# From the standard Wave VI - Odyssey ending. These tapes return directly from
# Focus 12 through a complete twelve-to-one waking count. Kept separate from
# return.gws's ten-to-one count and return-one.gws's learned instant exit.

@segment   return-twelve
@title     Ending — Focus 12 to Waking
@levels    F12
@fixed
@continuous-exit
@duration  ~1m20s

say Return now to full physical waking consciousness as I count from twelve back to one.
pause 5
say Twelve.
pause 3
say Eleven.
pause 3
level F10
say Ten.
pause 3
say Nine.
pause 3
say Eight.
pause 3
say Seven. Breathe deeply.
pause 3
say Six.
pause 3
say Five. Begin to move your physical body.
pause 3
say Four.
pause 3
say Three.
pause 3
say Two.
pause 3
say One. Awake and alert. Welcome back.
pause 8
